(/--- StaffSync Phase-Wise Implementation Documentation (Page 2 of 7) ---) '
() '
(### 1.2 Core Data Schemas) '
(1. **User Account \(`User`\)**:) '
(   - `_id`, `email`, `passwordHash`, `role` \(`'hr' | 'manager' | 'employee'`\), `emplo) '
(  yeeId`, `isActive`, `createdAt`, `updatedAt`.) '
(2. **Employee Profile \(`Employee`\)**:) '
(   - `_id`, `employeeCode` \(e.g., `EMP-1001`\), `firstName`, `lastName`, `email`, `dep) '
(  artmentId`, `designation`, `jobTitle`, `role`, `managerId`, `joiningDate`, `employm) '
(  entType` \(`Full-Time`, `Contract`, `Intern`\), `salary`, `phone`, `address`, `employ) '
(  mentStatus`.) '
(3. **Department \(`Department`\)**:) '
(   - `_id`, `name`, `code`, `headEmployeeId`, `budget`, `description`, `location`.) '
(4. **Attendance Record \(`Attendance`\)**:) '
(   - `_id`, `employeeId`, `date`, `checkIn`, `checkOut`, `workedMinutes`, `status` \(`) '
(  Present`, `Late`, `Half Day`, `Absent`, `On Leave`\), `remarks`, `correctionReason`,) '
(   `isCorrected`, `correctedBy`.) '
(5. **Leave Request \(`Leave`\)**:) '
(   - `_id`, `employeeId`, `leaveTypeId` \(`casual`, `sick`, `annual`, `unpaid`\), `star) '
(  tDate`, `endDate`, `totalDays`, `reason`, `status` \(`Pending Manager Approval`, `Pe) '
(  nding HR Approval`, `Approved`, `Rejected`, `Cancelled`\), `approvalHistory` array w) '
(  ith manager/HR review timestamps, comments, and decision audit.) '
(6. **Leave Balance \(`LeaveBalance`\)**:) '
(   - `_id`, `employeeId`, `leaveTypeId`, `allocatedDays`, `usedDays`, `pendingDays`, ) '
(  `year`.) '
(7. **Training Workshop \(`Training`\)**:) '
(   - `_id`, `title`, `description`, `departmentId`, `instructor`, `startDate`, `endDa) '
(  te`, `capacity`, `participants` array with progress tracking, completion status, an) '
(  d scores.) '
(8. **Announcement \(`Announcement`\)**:) '
(   - `_id`, `title`, `content`, `priority` \(`Low`, `Medium`, `High`, `Urgent`\), `auth) '
(  orId`, `targetDepartmentId`, `expiresAt`, `isActive`.) '
(9. **Audit Trail Log \(`AuditLog`\)**:) '
(   - `_id`, `action`, `performedBy`, `userRole`, `entityType`, `entityId`, `details`,) '
(   `ipAddress`, `timestamp`.) '
() '
(---) '
() '
(## Phase 2: Dual Storage Database Architecture) '
() '
(### 2.1 Objectives) '
(Eliminate local runtime blocking due to missing cloud credentials or network IP white) '
(  listing restrictions while providing seamless production MongoDB Atlas persistence.) '
() '
ET
endstream
