(/--- StaffSync Phase-Wise Implementation Documentation (Page 3 of 7) ---) '
() '
(### 2.2 Implementation) '
(- **Cloud Driver Connection**:) '
(  - Connects to remote MongoDB Atlas clusters using `mongoose.connect\(process.env.MON) '
(  GODB_URI\)`.) '
(  - Configures a 3-second non-blocking timeout with automatic reconnection handling.) '
(- **In-Memory Seeded Fallback**:) '
(  - Automatically activates if Atlas is unreachable or IP is not whitelisted.) '
(  - Seeds pre-populated organizations, departments, roles, active staff, leave histor) '
(  ies, attendance timestamps, and audit events.) '
(  - Zero disruption to frontend interfaces; queries and mutations reflect in runtime ) '
(  state.) '
(- **Health Diagnostic Endpoint \(`/api/v1/health`\)**:) '
(  - Exposes realtime status: `activeEngine` \(`'mongodb'` vs `'in-memory'`\), collectio) '
(  n counts, server uptime, and timestamp.) '
() '
(---) '
() '
(## Phase 3: Authentication & Role-Based Access Control \(RBAC\)) '
() '
(### 3.1 Objectives) '
(Deliver enterprise-grade JWT-based authentication paired with role-based routing and ) '
(  permissions for three distinct organizational personas.) '
() '
(### 3.2 Role Hierarchy) '
(1. **HR Administrator \(`hr`\)**:) '
(   - Full organizational oversight.) '
(   - Employee onboarding, salary viewing, department budgets, final leave approval, c) '
(  ompany announcements, audit trails, and data exports.) '
(2. **Team Manager \(`manager`\)**:) '
(   - Supervisory control over assigned direct reports.) '
(   - Stage 1 leave approvals, team attendance monitoring, team training oversight.) '
(3. **Employee \(`employee`\)**:) '
(   - Self-service portal: Punch-in/out, personal timesheets, leave balance viewing, l) '
(  eave application, assigned training completion, profile management.) '
() '
(### 3.3 Security Implementation) '
(- Passwords hashed using `bcryptjs` with salt rounds.) '
(- Signed JWT tokens \(`staffsync_token`\) stored securely in client state and passed vi) '
(  a HTTP `Authorization: Bearer <token>` headers.) '
(- Route protection middleware \(`authenticateToken`, `requireRole\(['hr', 'manager']\)`\)) '
(  .) '
() '
ET
endstream
endobj
