(### 5.3 Cancellation Lifecycle) '
(- Employees can cancel unapproved pending leaves at any time, immediately releasing t) '
(  he allocated days back to their available pool.) '
() '
(---) '
() '
(## Phase 6: Workforce Directory & Operational Modules) '
() '
(### 6.1 Objectives) '
(Centralize employee records, organizational divisions, skill building, and corporate ) '
(  communications.) '
() '
(### 6.2 Modules) '
(- **Employee Directory**:) '
(  - Searchable by name, email, department, role, or status.) '
(  - Modal view for personal contact info, joining date, reporting manager, and alloca) '
(  ted compensation.) '
(- **Department Units**:) '
(  - Engineering, Marketing, Human Resources, Product & Design, Sales.) '
(  - Head of department linking and allocated operating budgets.) '
(- **Training Workshops**:) '
(  - Course enrollment, progress percentage tracking, instructor tracking, and pass/fa) '
(  il certificates.) '
(- **Corporate Announcements**:) '
(  - Priority badging \(`High`, `Urgent`, `General`\), target department filtering, and ) '
(  expiry dates.) '
() '
(---) '
() '
(## Phase 7: Compliance, Audit Trails & CSV Reporting) '
() '
(### 7.1 Objectives) '
(Ensure regulatory compliance \(SOX, GDPR internal controls\) and operational visibility) '
ET
