() '
(### 7.2 Features) '
(- **Audit Trail Logging**:) '
(  - Automatically records every security-sensitive mutation \(logins, leave reviews, a) '
(  ttendance adjustments, profile updates\).) '
(  - Displays user ID, role, action, target entity, timestamp, and metadata diffs.) '
(- **Authorized CSV Exports**:) '
(  - One-click downloads for Workforce Roster, Attendance Records, Leave Utilization, ) '
(  and Audit Event Logs.) '
() '
(---) '
() '
(## Phase 8: Theme Engine & Dark Mode) '
() '
(### 8.1 Objectives) '
(Provide an accessible, eye-friendly dark mode experience that adheres to modern WCAG ) '
(  contrast ratios across all dashboards, tables, dialogs, and navigation controls.) '
() '
(### 8.2 Deliverables) '
(- **Tailwind CSS v4 Integration**:) '
(  - Configured `@custom-variant dark \(&:where\(.dark, .dark *\)\);` in `src/index.css`.) '
(- **State Management**:) '
(  - Created `ThemeContext` persisting state to `localStorage.staffsync_theme` and tog) '
(  gling `.dark` on `document.documentElement`.) '
(- **Universal Semantic Styling**:) '
(  - Mapped slate background and border utilities \(`bg-white` -> `bg-slate-900`, `bg-s) '
(  late-50` -> `bg-slate-950`\).) '
(  - Added dedicated theme toggle controls to both the **Top Navigation Bar** and **Lo) '
(  gin Screen**.) '
(  - Contrast polish on all badges, tables, inputs, stat cards, and action buttons.) '
() '
(---) '
() '
(## Phase 9: Quality Assurance & Automated Testing) '
() '
(### 9.1 Objectives) '
(Verify system integrity, deterministic seed state, cryptographic password hashing, ro) '
(  le boundaries, and leave calculations across automated test runners.) '
() '
(### 9.2 Test Suite Execution \(`tests/api.test.ts`\)) '
(17 automated integration assertions:) '
ET
